 ],
 "description": "The First 36 was built for one simple reason: joy in planing.\nNot just for weekend escapes, but also for family holidays, club races and every moment in between.\nShe is the first mainstream planing cruiser where onboard comfort and high-performance sailing no longer require compromise — they are one and the same. With vacuum-infused construction and an innovative design, her deck and interior bring the best of grand prix racing within reach of true sailors like you.\nOnce the hull lifts and the wake stretches cleanly behind you, you will feel the joy and remember why you sail in the first place.\nShe is our ultimate planing cruiser and the European Yacht of the Year 2023.\nInnovation and research : Sito",
